# The two mutations are distinguishable from each other by the statistic, which localises the break: the flag mutation
# suppresses the REPORT (reported=0) while the drain mutation suppresses the SAMPLE (reported=37, sampled=0). The
# manifest bin catches both; the statistic says which.
